n: 9.714285714285714\nmedian: 9\n\nMaybe round mean to something reasonable? I'll write full precision but that's fine. Or format mean with reasonable precision. I'll keep it simple: write mean as-is (repr of float). Cleaner: f\"{mean:.4f}\"? That loses precision. I'll write the values plainly, one per line, labeled.","signature":"9f48aebb45f34b47855e5249"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cd5afb85-d654-4e7f-b108-d602fff479bb","uuid":"eb5cab73-4131-45e5-b1ba-94a86884c97b","timestamp":"2026-10-31T18:47:52.360Z","thinking_duration_ms":8247,"thinking_display":"updates"}
